Error.description:
An error. Common statuses: 400 `invalid_idempotency_key`; 401 `missing_api_key` or `restricted_api_key`; 403 `invalid_api_key`,
`invalid_from_address`, `sending_paused` (team or tenant) or `invalid_access`; 404 `not_found`; 409 `invalid_idempotent_request` or `concurrent_idempotent_requests`;
422 `validation_error` (also: `tenant_id` conflicts with the domain's tenant; deleting a tenant that still has domains); 429 quota errors.
